          "heading": "Fiji concede 145 points across opening three matches of Nations Championship campaign",
          "body": "The Flying Fijians currently hold the bottom position in the Nations Championship table after failing to secure a victory in their first three fixtures. The side has conceded 145 points following their 17-33 defeat against Scotland in Round 3, resulting in a point difference of -96. Fiji have managed 49 points of their own during the tournament thus far and must now look to address these defensive concerns ahead of their next scheduled fixture against France."
