          "heading": "Chris Ashton admits deep regret regarding his England international playing career",
          "body": "Former England wing Chris Ashton has revealed he remains frustrated by his international career, stating he never achieved the success he desired in the white jersey. Despite becoming the all-time leading try-scorer in Premiership history and earning 44 caps, the 39-year-old admits, \"I'm still p*ssed off about England.\" Ashton, who scored 20 Test tries, claims he never felt he was given the proper opportunity to demonstrate his full understanding of the game while playing at the international level."
