          "heading": "Ireland Women’s Aoife Wafer ruled out of Japan Test after injury",
          "body": "Ireland back row Aoife Wafer has been ruled out of Sunday’s WXV Global Series encounter against Japan in Galway due to a minor injury sustained in training. Head coach Scott Bemand has responded to last weekend’s 40-36 defeat by the USA with 6 changes to his starting side, including Eilís Cahill’s first start in the front row. Bemand noted that the upcoming matches provide an \"ideal opportunity\" to refine the team's attacking prowess before facing South Africa."
