          "heading": "Uruguayan Flanker Lucas Bianchi Joins Italian Side Viadana For Season",
          "body": "Uruguayan international Lucas Bianchi has completed a move to Italy to join Viadana in the Serie A Elite competition. The 25-year-old flanker, who represented Uruguay at the 2023 Rugby World Cup, arrives from the Super Rugby Americas circuit. His move adds to the growing contingent of South American talent securing contracts in the Italian league as the buildup toward the 2027 Rugby World Cup in Australia intensifies."
