          "heading": "Santiago Carreras returns to Bath duty following his summer international window",
          "body": "Santiago Carreras has returned to club duty with Bath for the opening round of the Premiership season. The Pumas full-back, who featured throughout the recent international window, has been praised by director of rugby Johann van Graan for his “good character” and “jovial” nature. Despite past criticism regarding his decision-making in high-pressure matches, Van Graan remains confident in the playmaker, noting that in recent training sessions, “Santi was the best player on the planet.”"
