          "body": "Les Kiss has shifted Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii from outside centre to the left wing for Sunday’s Test against the Springboks, a decision designed to utilise the 23-year-old’s aerial skills against the world champions. While Suaalii has started all 24 of his previous Wallabies matches in the midfield, his coach expects the positional change to be smooth given his past experience at full-back. The selection coincides with the restoration of the long-standing midfield partnership between Hunter Paisami and Len Ikitau."
